# Writer (`agent/`)

This package narrates stored evidence. It is not a coding agent and must not grow tools.

- Official `anthropic` / `google-genai` SDKs via `agent/providers.py`. No LangChain. No web search. No live prices.
- Outlook: `agent/prompts.py` (`PROMPT_VERSION`, `SYSTEM_PROMPT`) + `agent/outlook.py`.
- Memos: `agent/memos.py` (`MEMO_PROMPT_VERSION`, schema `{why_scored, what_10q_changed, invalidation, caveats}`).
- After generation, `agent/citations.py` must pass. On failure, keep yesterday’s report (Outlook) or skip the memo.
- Template fallback when the API is down or `--template` is set.
- Pack assembly is Python → JSONB (`agent/pack.py`). The model never computes a multiple.

Prompt/citation changes: use skill `change-outlook-writer`.
